sequenceDiagram
  participant User
  participant App as App.jsx
  participant Drawer as DetailDrawer.jsx
  participant API as FastAPI main.py
  participant Ext as feeds/enrichment

  User->>App: click CVECard
  App->>API: GET /api/cves/{id}
  API->>Ext: Sploitus, GreyNoise, OTX, OSV, CIRCL
  Ext-->>API: enrichment fields
  API-->>App: full CVE object
  App->>Drawer: setSelectedCVE(full)

  par On drawer open
    Drawer->>API: GET /api/cves/{id}/sentences
    Drawer->>API: GET /api/cves/{id}/epss-history
    Drawer->>API: GET /api/cves/{id}/momentum
    Drawer->>API: GET /api/cves/{id}/correlation?sector=
  end

  Note over Drawer: ATLAS section expects atlas_techniques<br/>but GET /api/cves/{id} does not populate them (known issue)

  opt User opens Related tab
    Drawer->>API: GET /api/cves/{id}/related
  end

  opt User opens Detect tab
    Drawer->>API: GET /api/cves/{id}/detection
  end

  Drawer->>User: tabs render as each response arrives
